  "name": "vibe",
  "description": "This repository contains the datasets presented in VIBE: Vector Index Benchmark for Embeddings:\nhttps://github.com/vector-index-bench/vibe\nThe datasets can be downloaded manually from this repository, but the benchmark framework also downloads them automatically.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDatasets\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIn-distribution datasets\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nName\nType\nn\nd\nDistance\n\n\n\t\t\nagnews-mxbai-1024-euclidean\nText\n769,382\n1024\neuclidean\n\n\narxiv-nomic-768-normalized\nText\n1,344,643\n768\nany\n\n\ndpr-jina-768-normalized\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/vector-index-bench/vibe.",
